{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_shortbow","model_identifier":"halfling_shortbow","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"Shortbow, 39 u (1.1 m). Held in slot_hand_l: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side so it faces the archer when the bow is raised.\n\n## Set notes (from the equipment folder)\n\n# halfling_equipment\n\nStandalone copies of the A1 halfling equipment (crude-but-honest bloom iron and wood). Same geometry as the gear baked into halfling_spearman / halfling_archer. One bbmodel per item; no clips.\n\n- `halfling_shortspear.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Shortspear, 1.6 m (57 u): bloom-iron leaf head, ash shaft. Grip at the origin (17 u from the butt), point 41 u forward (-Z). One-handed (with buckler); if held two-handed the second grip is 12 u forward of the main grip.\n- `halfling_shortsword.bbmodel` (4 cubes): Shortsword, blade 16 u (45 cm), total 22 u. Grip at the origin, blade forward (-Z), edges up/down. One-handed. A sheathed copy hangs at slot_hip_l on halfling_archer.\n- `halfling_shortbow.bbmodel` (6 cubes): Shortbow, 39 u (1.1 m). Held in slot_hand_l: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side so it faces the archer when the bow is raised.\n- `halfling_buckler.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Buckler, about 30 cm (11 u) across, stepped round-ish planks with a bloom-iron boss. Gripped in the fist at slot_hand_l (origin = grip); face points -X with the arm hanging. Can also hang at slot_shield_l.\n- `halfling_iron_cap.bbmodel` (2 cubes): Iron cap for the halfling head (9 u): origin = slot_head (top centre of the head); one cube with helmet inflate 1.25 plus a knob.\n"},"description":"Shortbow, 39 u (1.1 m). Held in slot_hand_l: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side so it faces the archer when the bow is raised.\n\n## Set notes (from the equipment folder)\n\n# halfling_equipment\n\nStandalone copies of the A1 halfling equipment (crude-but-honest bloom iron and wood). Same geometry as the gear baked into halfling_spearman / halfling_archer. One bbmodel per item; no clips.\n\n- `halfling_shortspear.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Shortspear, 1.6 m (57 u): bloom-iron leaf head, ash shaft. Grip at the origin (17 u from the butt), point 41 u forward (-Z). One-handed (with buckler); if held two-handed the second grip is 12 u forward of the main grip.\n- `halfling_shortsword.bbmodel` (4 cubes): Shortsword, blade 16 u (45 cm), total 22 u. Grip at the origin, blade forward (-Z), edges up/down. One-handed. A sheathed copy hangs at slot_hip_l on halfling_archer.\n- `halfling_shortbow.bbmodel` (6 cubes): Shortbow, 39 u (1.1 m). Held in slot_hand_l: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side so it faces the archer when the bow is raised.\n- `halfling_buckler.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Buckler, about 30 cm (11 u) across, stepped round-ish planks with a bloom-iron boss. Gripped in the fist at slot_hand_l (origin = grip); face points -X with the arm hanging. Can also hang at slot_shield_l.\n- `halfling_iron_cap.bbmodel` (2 cubes): Iron cap for the halfling head (9 u): origin = slot_head (top centre of the head); one cube with helmet inflate 1.25 plus a knob.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"grip","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-0.75,-3.0],"to":[0.5,0.75,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,0,25.0,1.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[12,0,18.0,1.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[25,0,26.0,1.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18,0,24.0,1.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[10,0,11.0,6.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[11,0,12.0,6.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"79038bd7-f178-520e-b12e-e13df2d46534"},{"name":"limb_up","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"r